---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Ayudanos | PetVida" description="Descubre como puedes apoyar a nuestra fundacion. Dona dinero o en especie, o se voluntario. Cada aporte transforma la vida de nuestros peludos rescatados.">
  <main class="bg-white">
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- HERO SECTION                                 -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 lg:py-28" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFF5FA 0%, #FFE8F0 50%, #fff 100%);">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10">
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-[var(--color-pastel)] px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-primary)] font-[family-name:var(--font-ui)]">
          Haz la diferencia
        </span>
        <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-stone-900 tracking-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">
          Tu ayuda
          <span class="text-[var(--color-primary)]"> salva vidas</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="font-family: var(--font-body);">
          Con tu apoyo podemos seguir rescatando, protegiendo y encontrando hogares para los animales que mas nos necesitan. Cada aporte, por pequeno que sea, hace una gran diferencia.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="#donar-dinero" class="hero-btn hero-btn-primary !rounded-xl !px-6 !py-3">
            Donar dinero
          </a>
          <a href="#voluntariado" class="hero-btn hero-btn-secondary !rounded-xl !px-6 !py-3">
            Ser voluntario
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- DONAR DINERO                                 -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <section id="donar-dinero" class="py-20 bg-[var(--color-surface)]">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-14">
          <p class="eyebrow text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-semibold text-[var(--color-secondary)] font-[family-name:var(--font-ui)]">Apoyo economico</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-stone-900" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">
            Donaciones en <span class="text-[var(--color-primary)]">dinero</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-stone-600 max-w-xl mx-auto" style="font-family: var(--font-body);">
            Elige el medio que prefieras. Los datos de cuenta seran reemplazados cuando la fundacion nos los proporcione.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-pastel)] flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[var(--color-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h4.5c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v4.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-4.5A1.125 1.125 0 013.75 9.375v-4.5zM3.75 14.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h4.5c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v4.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-4.5a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125v-4.5zM13.5 4.875c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h4.5c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v4.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-4.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 9.375v-4.5z" />
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 6.75h.75v.75h-.75v-.75zM6.75 16.5h.75v.75h-.75v-.75zM16.5 6.75h.75v.75h-.75v-.75z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-2">Codigo QR</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-500 mb-6">Escanea el codigo con tu app bancaria para donar al instante.</p>
            <img
              src="https://placehold.co/280x280/FFCBDE/F42476?text=QR+Aquí&font=raleway"
              alt="Codigo QR para donaciones (placeholder)"
              class="w-56 h-56 rounded-2xl border-2 border-dashed border-stone-200 p-2"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-stone-400 italic">Imagen de referencia. La fundacion proporcionara el QR real.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm border border-stone-100 space-y-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-800 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-pastel)] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 8.25h19.5M2.25 9h19.5m-16.5 5.25h6m-6 2.25h3m-3.75 3h15a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 004.5 19.5z" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              Transferencia bancaria
            </h3>

            <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 p-4">
                <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Banco</p>
                <p class="text-stone-800 font-semibold">[Nombre del banco]</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 p-4">
                <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Tipo y numero de cuenta</p>
                <p class="text-stone-800 font-semibold">[Cuenta Corriente / Ahorros - XXXXXXXXXX]</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 p-4">
                <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Titular</p>
                <p class="text-stone-800 font-semibold">[Nombre de la fundacion]</p>
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 p-4">
                <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">NIT</p>
                <p class="text-stone-800 font-semibold">[NIT de la fundacion]</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="border-stone-200" />

            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[color:rgba(32,200,241,0.12)] flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-secondary)]" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-1 17.93c-3.95-.49-7-3.85-7-7.93 0-.62.08-1.21.21-1.79L9 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93zm6.9-2.54c-.26-.81-1-1.39-1.9-1.39h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1H8v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-.41c2.93 1.19 5 4.06 5 7.41 0 2.08-.8 3.97-2.1 5.39z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-wide">Nequi / Daviplata</p>
                <p class="text-stone-800 font-semibold">[XXX-XXX-XXXX]</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs text-stone-400 italic">Todos los datos seran actualizados cuando la fundacion los proporcione.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- DONAR EN ESPECIE                             -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <section id="donar-especie" class="py-20 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-14">
          <p class="eyebrow text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-semibold text-[var(--color-secondary)] font-[family-name:var(--font-ui)]">Donaciones en especie</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-stone-900" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">
            Lo que <span class="text-[var(--color-primary)]">necesitan</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-stone-600 max-w-xl mx-auto" style="font-family: var(--font-body);">
            Tambien puedes donar articulos esenciales para el cuidado diario de nuestros peludos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm border border-stone-100 text-center hover:shadow-md transition">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-pastel)] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[var(--color-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0112 21 8.25 8.25 0 016.038 7.048 8.287 8.287 0 009 9.6a8.983 8.983 0 013.361-6.867 8.21 8.21 0 003 2.48z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-2">Alimento</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Concentrado para perros y gatos de todas las edades (cachorro, adulto, senior).</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm border border-stone-100 text-center hover:shadow-md transition">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-pastel)] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[var(--color-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-2">Medicinas</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Desparasitantes, antipulgas, antibioticos, vitaminas y material de curacion.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm border border-stone-100 text-center hover:shadow-md transition">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-pastel)] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[var(--color-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09zM18.259 8.715L18 9.75l-.259-1.035a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.455-2.456L14.25 6l1.036-.259a3.375 3.375 0 002.455-2.456L18 2.25l.259 1.035a3.375 3.375 0 002.455 2.456L21.75 6l-1.036.259a3.375 3.375 0 00-2.455 2.456zM16.894 20.567L16.5 21.75l-.394-1.183a2.25 2.25 0 00-1.423-1.423L13.5 18.75l1.183-.394a2.25 2.25 0 001.423-1.423l.394-1.183.394 1.183a2.25 2.25 0 001.423 1.423l1.183.394-1.183.394a2.25 2.25 0 00-1.423 1.423z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-2">Aseo</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Jabon, cloro, detergente, bolsas de basura, escobas, traperos y toallas.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm border border-stone-100 text-center hover:shadow-md transition">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-pastel)] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[var(--color-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 9.563C9 9.252 9.252 9 9.563 9h4.874c.311 0 .563.252.563.563v4.874c0 .311-.252.563-.563.563H9.564A.562.562 0 019 14.437V9.564z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-2">Arena para gatos</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Arena sanitaria para mantener limpios y comodos a nuestros gatos.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm border border-stone-100 text-center hover:shadow-md transition">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-pastel)] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[var(--color-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 3h1.386c.51 0 .955.343 1.087.835l.383 1.437M7.5 14.25a3 3 0 00-3 3h15.75m-12.75-3h11.218c1.121-2.3 2.1-4.684 2.924-7.138a60.114 60.114 0 00-16.536-1.84M7.5 14.25L5.106 5.272M6 20.25a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0zm12.75 0a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-2">Accesorios</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Camas, casas plasticas, cobijas, collares, correas, juguetes y comedores.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm border border-stone-100 text-center hover:shadow-md transition">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[var(--color-pastel)] flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
              <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[var(--color-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 7.5l-.625 10.632a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.247 2.118H6.622a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.247-2.118L3.75 7.5M10 11.25h4M3.375 7.5h17.25c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H3.375c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-2">Otros</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">Cualquier otro articulo util que quieras donar. Todo suma y es bien recibido.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 bg-[color:var(--color-pastel)] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-stone-800">Donde y cuando entregar?</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mt-1">[Direccion del refugio] &middot; Horario: [Dias y horas de recepcion]</p>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/57XXXXXXXXXX?text=Hola%20PetVida,%20quiero%20coordinar%20una%20donacion%20en%20especie"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:opacity-90 shrink-0"
            style="background: #25D366;"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
            Coordinar donacion
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <!-- VOLUNTARIADO                                 -->
    <!-- ============================================ -->
    <section id="voluntariado" class="py-20 bg-[var(--color-surface)]">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="text-center mb-14">
          <p class="eyebrow text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-semibold text-[var(--color-secondary)] font-[family-name:var(--font-ui)]">Voluntariado</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-stone-900" style="font-family: var(--font-display);">
            Dona tu <span class="text-[var(--color-primary)]">tiempo</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-stone-600 max-w-xl mx-auto" style="font-family: var(--font-body);">
            Si no puedes donar dinero o especie, tu tiempo y habilidades tambien son un regalo invaluable para nuestros peludos.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm border border-stone-100">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-pastel)] flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 002.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 004.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 00-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128v.106A12.318 12.318 0 018.624 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766l-.001-.109a6.375 6.375 0 0111.964-3.07M12 6.375a3.375 3.375 0 11-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 016.75 0zm8.25 2.25a2.625 2.625 0 11-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 015.25 0z" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              Voluntariado presencial
            </h3>
            <p class="text-stone-500 text-sm mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Ven al refugio y comparte tiempo de calidad con nuestros animales. Te necesitamos para:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-stone-600">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-secondary)] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                Pasear y socializar perros
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-secondary)] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                Alimentar y cuidar de los animales
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-secondary)] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                Limpieza y mantenimiento del refugio
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--color-secondary)] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
                Apoyo en eventos y jornadas de adopcion
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-8 shadow-sm border border-stone-100">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-800 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
